; Copies LinkAgent to the boot disk: C:LinkAgent and S:LinkAgent-startup.
Copy LinkAgent:LinkAgent C:LinkAgent
Copy LinkAgent:S/LinkAgent-startup S:LinkAgent-startup
Echo "Installed C:LinkAgent and S:LinkAgent-startup."
Echo "To start LinkAgent at every boot, add this line to"
Echo "S:Startup-Sequence just before EndCLI:"
Echo "  Execute S:LinkAgent-startup"
